NEARS-2096 delta re-QA cycle 2 — AC2 live focus-state timeline
Surface: widgetbook/ (flutter build web --release, served python3 -m http.server
8934, headless Chromium via Playwright, /usr/bin/python3). Semantics enabled via
enable_flutter_semantics(). Signal: document.activeElement (tag/aria-label/role),
read live in-session with mcp devtools-equivalent Playwright script (see
scratchpad qa_repro.py / qa_repro2.py, reproduced below verbatim from the actual
run output).

== Run 1 — collapse-to-idle-root, then self-heal (no Tab press) ==
fresh mount:                              {tag: FLT-SEMANTICS, aria: 'I agree to the terms', role: checkbox}
after click into Search field (238,20,..): {tag: FLT-SEMANTICS, aria: 'I agree to the terms', role: checkbox}  (unchanged; click missed the field's live hit-test region)
